WEBVTT

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:07.400
Towa is probably the strongest supernatural in history.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.070
Quon is invincible.

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:14.110
Then why isn't he here?!

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:15.820
Surrender.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:17.710
Shun...

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:22.540
Please save us.

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.370
Quon-sama.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.920
Password: Iconoclasm.

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:31.880
Death... is catching up to me.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.130
Get out of there, Quon!

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:36.930
Why?

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:37.850
Why?!

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:44.770
What did you do with the kids you hunted?

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:45.890
You didn't!

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:52.400
I can see my mom.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:56.820
Tei!

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:58.110
Kamishiro!

00:00:58.110 --> 00:00:59.720
Don't take the kids!

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:09.060
Operation complete.

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.180
Releasing the perimeter and heading back.

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:12.510
This is HQ. Roger.

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:14.570
Check for action by any public institution.

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:16.050
Roger. Checking now.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:21.560
The police and fire departments are on the move,
but the situation is well protected.

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:31.360
Take care of everyone here.

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:32.650
Quon!

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:33.820
What are you going to do?!

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:37.420
I need... to get Towa and everyone else.

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:39.050
Wait.

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:41.160
Seiji!

00:01:42.050 --> 00:01:46.910
Even if you go alone, you won't stand a chance against him.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:49.450
We have to do this together.

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:50.920
We need a plan.

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:53.390
Towa's at Custos Headquarters!

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:55.160
How do I get in?

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:56.180
Please tell me!

00:01:56.180 --> 00:01:58.050
It's going to be difficult.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:02.020
I can download the location of their headquarters,

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:05.180
but I can no longer manipulate their security system very easily.

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:10.940
When we did maintenance on you the other time,

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:13.440
we obtained some data.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:17.370
Maybe we can use it to hack into their network.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:21.570
If I access their security system from the inside, maybe I can pull it off.

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.580
Ryou, can you do that for me?

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:33.250
Sorry.

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:36.730
I'm the one who should be sorry.

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:38.410
I kept quiet about Towa.

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:41.360
No, you were protecting me.

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:42.790
Thank you.

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:43.860
Um...

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:48.020
What's going on, exactly?

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:54.270
A long, long time ago,

00:02:55.800 --> 00:03:01.160
mankind viewed abilities like the ones you have as nothing special.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:08.870
But... due to a mutation, the supernaturals became the minority.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:14.640
Eventually, the non-supernaturals started to oppress them.

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:24.390
The non-supernaturals displayed excessive fear about supernatural abilities.

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:29.220
Youkai, mononoke, other spirits...

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:33.290
Quon's tribe was demonized in countless way.

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:38.400
They were chased away from civilization and had to live in secrecy.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:42.860
That sounds just like Fantasium Garden.

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:49.290
Ever since, Quon's tribe has strictly forbidden the use of its powers,

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.870
fearing that would lead to wars.

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:53.840
Then what happened?

00:03:54.510 --> 00:04:05.220
Generals and nobles have a long history of hunting youkai and monsters to burnish their reputations.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:10.100
That night... the night of the annual festival...

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:14.100
the people of the town attacked our village.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:20.860
And that started everything?

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:25.810
For whatever reason, Towa sealed himself in a crystal,

00:04:25.810 --> 00:04:28.570
and Quon became immortal.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:37.130
Later, my ancestors found Quon alone at the site of the massacre and took him into custody.

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:41.920
Something's been bothering me ever since I was a child.

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:46.170
Why doesn't he wake up?

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:49.530
Is he unable to forgive himself?

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:52.640
I'll go too!

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:54.580
You're going to save Towa, right?

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:56.000
I'll go too.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.650
We need to get Tei and that blockhead as well.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:00.580
Yuri...

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:01.610
Me too!

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:08.620
Takao-san was really impressed when I put up a force field.

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:10.080
So me too!

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:13.400
Everyone...

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:16.550
I'm sorry.

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:31.600
Chapter 6 ｢The Endless Eternity」

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:38.600
You can't sleep?

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:40.610
Yeah.

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:44.460
My grandma teaches dance.

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:45.640
It's amazing.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:49.620
She can make anyone dance beautifully.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.420
I like this song.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:05.030
Thank you.

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:08.110
My mom and dad wrote it.

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:11.620
I was very confused.

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:14.770
I didn't know why I had powers.

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:17.270
One day, I realized something.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:20.590
My parents also had their own powers.

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:26.360
Writing songs, cooking delicious meals, or drawing pictures...

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:29.470
Those are also powers.

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:32.370
Everyone has their own special powers.

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:38.380
Towa...

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:52.800
I wonder... what your brother and the others are going through right now.

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:55.510
That night...

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:00.520
I was the only one not at the village.

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:03.330
I just wanted to be carefree and slack off.

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:20.040
I can use this as my excuse.

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:33.730
Damn.

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:35.550
I screwed up.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.020
I couldn't protect anyone.

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:47.600
Not my people... Not Towa...

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:55.280
Towa had a benevolent heart.

00:07:56.210 --> 00:08:01.910
One of these days, I'm sure we'll stop caring about our differences.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:07.880
That day, I swore I'd never make the same mistake again.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.300
I'm sorry for not telling you.

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:13.980
Don't be.

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:15.260
It made me happy...

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:19.320
that you told me about yourself.

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:24.850
Because you always felt so far away, Quon.

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:31.420
No matter how many hundreds or thousands of years you've lived,

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:33.450
I... I...

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:47.030
Ryou said he's ready.

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:50.420
This is a diagram of Custos Headquarters.

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:53.300
There are two signals: here and here.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:54.570
Tei and Towa?

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:55.930
I think so.

00:08:58.690 --> 00:09:01.390
I'll guide you once we get in.

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:08.900
That Kamishiro guy hasn't said anything yet.

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:11.420
Isn't this just a prison?

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:14.740
Hey, can we really see our parents?

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.460
Hey, Takao-san?

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:18.410
Shut up.

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:21.330
Shut up. Shut up. Shut up!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:31.090
90 seconds until we start.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:40.050
Security system down.

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:42.260
Unlocking the gate.

00:09:58.900 --> 00:09:59.490
What's this?

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:00.550
What's going on?!

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:01.810
No way!

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:03.450
Did they detect my intrusion?

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:16.850
Hizuru!

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:20.080
I'll take care of things here.

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:21.600
You guys go ahead.

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:22.600
But...

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:25.150
I have my own scores to settle.

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:40.530
Go!

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:54.630
Are you done yet?

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:57.020
She's connected now.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:03.600
But... she's not mentally stable, so it might not work as planned.

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:06.600
I don't care. Just do it.

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:09.350
Roger.

00:11:15.490 --> 00:11:17.830
Don't try to resist.

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:19.690
It'll only increase your pain.

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:33.380
Yuri, go on ahead!

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:39.590
This won't help me figure out where everyone is!

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:42.590
We'll just have to look everywhere we can.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:45.630
Leave it to me.

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:23.340
I don't want to fight you.

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:26.520
You saw the kids yourself.

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:28.100
They're all normal people!

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:31.890
They disrupt order.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:40.480
They disrupt order, and that makes them evil.

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:55.750
Hizuru.

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:01.870
Quon-sama...

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:02.840
Everyone...

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:08.340
Increase the output.

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:10.360
That will put her in danger!

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:13.420
We've never cared about their lives.

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:16.330
R-Roger.

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:23.240
I just heard Tei.

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:24.320
Yeah, me too.

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:26.870
It's this way!

00:13:33.760 --> 00:13:35.200
Why do you refuse?

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:36.700
Why won't you awaken?

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:38.120
We can't stop Insania.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:39.910
Permission to use GA Avian.

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:41.530
Roger, permission granted.

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:35.600
Shun...

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:41.530
I regained my heart.

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:43.610
And... you too...

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:51.530
Right?

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:56.370
You... too...

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:28.250
Hizuru!

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:29.110
You're in the way!

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:32.990
This ends now!

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:04.230
Why?

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:07.140
Don't get me wrong.

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:10.230
I've owed you since our first battle.

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:15.880
Now I can rest.

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:20.300
Hizuru!

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:30.310
Insania has infiltrated the Central Tower.

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:33.340
Heading due west through Area 313.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.940
Towa, where are you?

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:37.680
Towa!

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:55.860
Taka-bou...

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:23.810
Towa!

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:25.140
My goodness.

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:27.810
I had no problem bringing him here,

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.900
but look how fast it's growing.

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:31.770
Kamishiro!

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.630
This place won't last much longer.

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:40.110
Still, Towa has awakened, luckily.

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:42.350
With his power in my hand...

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:45.870
I don't have any reason to stay here.

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:51.340
He'll never be yours!

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:52.500
Whoa there.

00:17:58.280 --> 00:17:59.230
Nii-san...

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:02.100
Nii-san...

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:04.140
Towa...

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:05.890
Towa!

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:08.360
No, Nii-san!

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:10.900
Towa! Towa!

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:16.970
Takao-san?

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:17.900
What do you think you're doing?

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.700
C-Come with us!

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:21.910
You're done sneaking around!

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:24.640
Is that Kamishiro's order?

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:26.790
Do you seriously believe his words?

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:32.670
He's the very man who's been chasing us all this time!

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:33.800
I'm going home.

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:37.170
I want to go back home.

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:39.470
For that, I'd...

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:41.640
Takao-san...

00:18:42.770 --> 00:18:43.970
For goodness sakes...

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:51.540
Move! I need to go save Tei!

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:52.220
No!

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:52.930
Taka-bou!

00:18:52.930 --> 00:18:54.040
Stop!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:58.740
Will that Kamishiro guy really make our parents happy too?

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:03.500
Will the man who's been killing us really make us happy now?

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:05.390
Will he, Takao-san?!

00:19:09.610 --> 00:19:10.290
What?

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:12.460
Insania is still...

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:15.740
What's going on?

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:16.970
The system's going down.

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:19.920
It isn't due to an attack or physical damage.

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:22.030
Main server inaccessible.

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:23.220
What's going on?

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:28.470
I'm back online.

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:31.230
It looks like something happened to their system.

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:43.500
HQ, do you copy?

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:44.010
HQ!

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:44.920
Anything?

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:46.780
Nothing. There's no connection.

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:51.290
We've lost communications with the Operations Team.

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:53.610
System unrecoverable.

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:58.000
All system authority has been transferred to Ordo?!

00:19:58.440 --> 00:19:59.510
What?

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:03.130
What's this?

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:20.340
I guess the Council has started to take action.

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:28.450
Bang. Bang.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:42.170
So you'll fight death and live to suffer?

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:55.490
Wh-What'll we do?

00:20:55.490 --> 00:20:57.190
Guys, can you hear me?

00:20:57.670 --> 00:20:58.440
Ryou!

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:01.220
Good. You're all safe.

00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:02.680
Well, not exactly.

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:04.320
Calm down and listen to me.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:07.950
That facility's self-destruct sequence has been activated.

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:09.380
Self-destruct?

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:10.400
What do you mean?

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:12.510
I don't know who initiated it,

00:21:12.510 --> 00:21:18.220
but because the system there is down,
it was probably activated from the outside.

00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:21.590
Still, thanks to that, I'm online again.

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:22.860
Takao-san.

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:25.970
What's going to happen to us now?

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:28.310
We're gonna drown at this rate.

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:30.030
I want to see my parents.

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:31.370
Takao-san.

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:37.730
God damn it!

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:41.290
Guys, get close to me.

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:42.430
And you guys too!

00:21:43.390 --> 00:21:45.950
No! You can't take all of us at once.

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:47.560
Just come!

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:51.950
I... was an idiot.

00:21:57.560 --> 00:21:58.210
Let's go.

00:22:20.620 --> 00:22:21.980
My legs are gone!

00:22:22.370 --> 00:22:23.360
Takao-san!

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:24.550
That's because you tried too hard.

00:22:24.550 --> 00:22:25.730
Shut up!

00:22:27.620 --> 00:22:28.280
Tei!

00:22:30.190 --> 00:22:32.140
Tei! Talk to me!

00:22:32.140 --> 00:22:33.030
Do you recognize me?

00:22:34.450 --> 00:22:35.460
Yuri...

00:22:36.090 --> 00:22:37.850
Yuuma-kun too.

00:22:37.850 --> 00:22:39.040
Thank you.

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:44.680
What the hell is this?

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.250
Are they going to destroy the entire place?

00:22:47.250 --> 00:22:48.550
I see.

00:22:49.320 --> 00:22:51.720
I guess they have no use for us anymore.

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:54.470
I'll do it.

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:57.240
Guys, gather around me.

00:22:57.810 --> 00:23:00.070
Not in your current state.

00:23:00.070 --> 00:23:01.810
You'll break your neck or your spine next!

00:23:02.970 --> 00:23:04.960
It's the least I can do for my stupidity.

00:23:04.960 --> 00:23:06.560
I put everyone in danger.

00:23:07.470 --> 00:23:09.700
Aren't you going to see your family?

00:23:10.340 --> 00:23:13.000
We're getting out alive, for sure.

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:14.450
And I mean all of us.

00:23:18.490 --> 00:23:19.460
I found one!

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:22.460
Yuri, I've found an escape route.

00:23:23.610 --> 00:23:24.630
Got it. Thanks!

00:23:25.700 --> 00:23:26.920
Where are Quon and Shun?

00:23:31.320 --> 00:23:33.400
Tei, I need a favor.

00:23:33.400 --> 00:23:34.390
Can you tell everyone?

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:37.180
Everyone?

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:48.220
We can't go through this door.

00:23:48.220 --> 00:23:50.050
It's already filled with water.

00:23:50.050 --> 00:23:51.680
What about the emergency hatch?

00:23:51.680 --> 00:23:53.220
It's locked. We can't open it.

00:23:54.990 --> 00:23:55.870
What was that?

00:23:56.640 --> 00:23:57.540
Something just...

00:23:57.890 --> 00:24:00.190
Unable to stop self-destruct sequence.

00:24:02.390 --> 00:24:04.290
The timer's been activated.

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:07.710
All emergency routes have been locked as well.

00:24:07.710 --> 00:24:09.870
Unable to find an escape route.

00:24:09.870 --> 00:24:12.540
The Operations Team is also trapped.

00:24:13.440 --> 00:24:15.020
What can we do?

00:24:16.400 --> 00:24:16.970
What was that?

00:24:17.830 --> 00:24:19.180
An escape route?

00:24:20.240 --> 00:24:22.100
Is this... a larva's voice?

00:24:24.540 --> 00:24:25.870
We're at G_006!

00:24:25.870 --> 00:24:27.570
Then take a right.

00:24:31.360 --> 00:24:33.360
Take a right at G_006...

00:24:34.270 --> 00:24:35.360
Should we trust that voice?

00:24:37.940 --> 00:24:39.840
The information is precise.

00:24:39.840 --> 00:24:42.340
If we follow the cracks the destruct sequence has caused,

00:24:42.340 --> 00:24:43.750
we can get to the surface.

00:24:45.550 --> 00:24:47.880
As of right now, we're abandoning the base!

00:24:48.360 --> 00:24:50.420
Everyone, make your escape!

00:24:54.230 --> 00:24:55.590
This way!

00:24:56.680 --> 00:24:58.010
That way is blocked.

00:24:58.370 --> 00:25:00.890
Take a left at the blockage and go up the stairs.

00:25:05.520 --> 00:25:07.230
The stairs at B_204?

00:25:07.640 --> 00:25:09.050
What should we do?

00:25:09.050 --> 00:25:11.480
It could be a trap.

00:25:12.560 --> 00:25:14.570
That way's blocked.

00:25:14.570 --> 00:25:16.530
I think we can trust them.

00:25:16.530 --> 00:25:17.620
Let's move!

00:25:31.650 --> 00:25:32.680
Nii-san...

00:25:35.690 --> 00:25:36.590
Towa!

00:25:37.470 --> 00:25:38.470
Nii-san!

00:25:39.310 --> 00:25:40.470
I'm coming.

00:25:46.550 --> 00:25:48.030
It's too late.

00:25:48.030 --> 00:25:50.230
Soon, I will have Towa inside me.

00:25:50.600 --> 00:25:51.650
Stop.

00:25:52.010 --> 00:25:53.230
Stop!

00:25:58.590 --> 00:25:59.450
Towa!

00:26:11.380 --> 00:26:13.130
Towa!

00:26:24.380 --> 00:26:25.520
Hurry!

00:26:28.660 --> 00:26:29.520
Stop!

00:26:29.930 --> 00:26:31.440
Make a turn right there.

00:26:39.680 --> 00:26:41.530
Oh, my God...

00:26:42.190 --> 00:26:46.620
Even if we get past this debris, the gate on the other side is already locked.

00:26:46.620 --> 00:26:47.040
Ryou!

00:26:47.040 --> 00:26:50.540
All the other routes are under water from that explosion.

00:26:51.870 --> 00:26:55.000
That gate is the only possible way out.

00:26:55.000 --> 00:26:56.360
No...

00:26:59.050 --> 00:26:59.900
I'll do it.

00:26:59.900 --> 00:27:01.780
No, it's too dangerous.

00:27:01.780 --> 00:27:02.700
But!

00:27:02.700 --> 00:27:03.870
I'll do it.

00:27:06.570 --> 00:27:09.140
I've always been running.

00:27:13.580 --> 00:27:15.400
From this power...

00:27:15.400 --> 00:27:17.400
and from the people with this power.

00:27:19.710 --> 00:27:22.410
I couldn't protect Lisa.

00:27:23.060 --> 00:27:24.000
Not even close.

00:27:24.000 --> 00:27:29.160
In fact, I killed her with my own hands.

00:27:31.070 --> 00:27:33.750
If I'd been able to protect her instead,

00:27:34.130 --> 00:27:37.130
she could've chased countless dreams...

00:27:37.700 --> 00:27:41.630
and perhaps created a happy family.

00:27:42.070 --> 00:27:45.890
But I ended her future...

00:27:46.570 --> 00:27:49.390
with these very hands.

00:27:50.570 --> 00:27:52.650
Now I'm through with running.

00:27:53.270 --> 00:27:54.520
I'm moving forward.

00:27:54.520 --> 00:27:58.090
There's nothing to fear or feel embarrassed about.

00:27:58.090 --> 00:28:00.610
Mankind has the potential to do anything,

00:28:00.610 --> 00:28:07.660
and your powers are undoubtedly a part of humanity's potential.

00:28:08.140 --> 00:28:11.160
So nothing can stop you from moving forward.

00:28:12.870 --> 00:28:13.870
Shun-san!

00:28:43.320 --> 00:28:46.840
The younger brother wakes up to his older brother's shouts.

00:28:47.520 --> 00:28:51.330
You did just what I expected you to do.

00:28:53.590 --> 00:28:57.680
Now, Towa will literally become mine.

00:29:01.070 --> 00:29:02.200
Sto—

00:29:03.970 --> 00:29:06.680
Nii... Nii-san!

00:29:11.350 --> 00:29:12.680
Towa!

00:29:20.320 --> 00:29:21.560
Nii-san!

00:29:43.890 --> 00:29:44.380
Shoot!

00:29:45.270 --> 00:29:46.340
Yuri! Tei!

00:29:46.860 --> 00:29:49.540
Can't we save them somehow?

00:29:50.880 --> 00:29:54.040
It's obvious that Ordo is pulling the strings here.

00:29:54.950 --> 00:29:57.900
If what we're doing is also part of their plan,

00:29:57.900 --> 00:30:00.230
then we can't just take action carelessly.

00:30:00.230 --> 00:30:01.660
No...

00:30:03.320 --> 00:30:05.680
Everyone, please be safe.

00:30:15.950 --> 00:30:17.390
Yuuma-kun!

00:30:17.390 --> 00:30:18.720
You saved us.

00:30:18.720 --> 00:30:19.460
Thanks.

00:30:22.140 --> 00:30:23.400
Nice going.

00:30:33.330 --> 00:30:34.630
This is nice.

00:30:34.630 --> 00:30:37.650
I feel more powerful than I'd expected.

00:30:38.980 --> 00:30:40.770
Give him back...

00:30:41.120 --> 00:30:43.520
Don't shame my brother.

00:30:47.150 --> 00:30:51.390
This isn't the world Towa wanted!

00:30:51.390 --> 00:30:54.160
You won't have your way!

00:30:54.160 --> 00:30:55.740
I see.

00:30:55.740 --> 00:30:58.430
If we can't see eye to eye,

00:30:58.430 --> 00:31:01.290
then you're just a nuisance.

00:31:08.410 --> 00:31:09.130
Quon!

00:31:09.580 --> 00:31:11.050
What's going on?

00:31:11.050 --> 00:31:13.010
The commander... is a larva?

00:31:20.490 --> 00:31:23.020
Now, let's get this concert underway!

00:31:35.260 --> 00:31:36.830
Yuuma-kun!

00:31:36.830 --> 00:31:37.780
Tei?

00:31:59.640 --> 00:32:01.110
Get a hold of yourself, Tei-san!

00:32:01.110 --> 00:32:01.890
Takao-san!

00:32:01.890 --> 00:32:02.600
Stop!

00:32:03.070 --> 00:32:04.440
But...

00:32:10.150 --> 00:32:11.790
Don't worry.

00:32:11.790 --> 00:32:13.390
Just calm down.

00:32:13.390 --> 00:32:15.910
If you stay strong, you'll be able to control it.

00:32:23.950 --> 00:32:25.420
No! Stop!

00:32:25.420 --> 00:32:26.460
Don't shoot!

00:32:28.960 --> 00:32:31.930
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:32:31.930 --> 00:32:35.580
By pairing up powers, I can create an infinite amount of abilities.

00:32:51.950 --> 00:32:52.900
Towa...

00:32:55.450 --> 00:32:56.540
Everyone...

00:32:59.910 --> 00:33:01.160
I...

00:33:03.490 --> 00:33:04.670
I...

00:33:08.260 --> 00:33:11.560
failed... again.

00:33:40.500 --> 00:33:47.730
Time guides you

00:33:47.740 --> 00:33:53.280
The future is vast

00:33:50.750 --> 00:33:51.960
Everyone...

00:33:53.300 --> 00:33:57.380
Time ticks in circles,

00:33:56.760 --> 00:33:57.590
I'm sorry.

00:33:57.380 --> 00:34:05.880
bringing hope each time around

00:33:58.910 --> 00:34:02.630
I did as much as I could.

00:34:06.040 --> 00:34:12.830
Maybe you had a bad day,

00:34:06.220 --> 00:34:09.230
Did I do my best?

00:34:12.910 --> 00:34:18.480
and it stopped you in your tracks

00:34:18.830 --> 00:34:25.270
But days move on,

00:34:23.870 --> 00:34:25.100
I see.

00:34:25.270 --> 00:34:31.210
quietly but surely

00:34:33.630 --> 00:34:34.500
Then...

00:34:39.310 --> 00:34:41.390
I need to do better!

00:34:51.680 --> 00:34:53.900
I can do more!

00:34:55.070 --> 00:34:56.740
You're so persistent.

00:35:13.580 --> 00:35:14.670
Quon!

00:35:20.720 --> 00:35:22.970
What a nice piece of art.

00:35:35.480 --> 00:35:37.820
Why don't you try something new?!

00:35:40.180 --> 00:35:40.880
Quon!

00:35:40.880 --> 00:35:41.660
Quon-sama!

00:35:42.620 --> 00:35:44.490
This is the limit of your power.

00:35:49.100 --> 00:35:52.040
At last... I can touch you!

00:36:02.560 --> 00:36:03.970
Towa.

00:36:03.970 --> 00:36:05.540
You're still alive.

00:36:06.710 --> 00:36:08.990
I'm sorry for keeping you waiting.

00:36:08.990 --> 00:36:12.520
I wasn't... I wasn't mentally strong enough.

00:36:12.520 --> 00:36:14.620
No, Nii-san.

00:36:14.620 --> 00:36:17.410
I'm the one who needs to apologize.

00:36:19.020 --> 00:36:25.160
That day, I awakened your powers by force.

00:36:26.700 --> 00:36:29.160
I'm the reason our village was attacked.

00:36:30.840 --> 00:36:36.040
As the massacre proceeded, fear engulfed me.

00:36:36.040 --> 00:36:40.550
Then, I just tried to protect myself.

00:36:42.080 --> 00:36:44.650
Everyone feels fear!

00:36:44.650 --> 00:36:46.480
There's no reason for you to feel guilty!

00:36:46.480 --> 00:36:48.180
That's not it!

00:36:48.180 --> 00:36:52.230
I called for you in my heart.

00:36:52.230 --> 00:36:55.260
I couldn't do anything.

00:36:55.260 --> 00:36:57.780
I couldn't save anyone.

00:36:57.780 --> 00:37:02.190
So I gave you all of my burdens.

00:37:21.420 --> 00:37:24.890
I sullied your hands with blood.

00:37:24.890 --> 00:37:27.600
Because I was a coward!

00:37:38.330 --> 00:37:41.690
Then... there's only one thing we need to do.

00:37:45.550 --> 00:37:49.120
Let's settle our millennium old business together.

00:38:29.660 --> 00:38:34.450
I'm going to monopolize all the power!

00:39:14.590 --> 00:39:15.990
Thank you.

00:39:15.990 --> 00:39:17.270
Towa!

00:39:18.490 --> 00:39:19.250
Don't go!

00:39:21.590 --> 00:39:24.390
Towa!

00:39:25.400 --> 00:39:26.710
No...

00:39:26.710 --> 00:39:30.580
It's all mine!

00:40:00.780 --> 00:40:03.300
I-I'm also a larva!

00:40:03.300 --> 00:40:05.320
I'm one of you.

00:40:05.320 --> 00:40:09.550
You... You protect your kind, right?

00:40:15.390 --> 00:40:17.530
Quon, did you kill people?

00:40:17.530 --> 00:40:18.340
You liar!

00:40:18.340 --> 00:40:19.310
Murderer!

00:40:19.310 --> 00:40:20.030
No...

00:40:20.030 --> 00:40:21.130
Stay back.

00:40:32.910 --> 00:40:36.610
Terminal destruct sequence has been properly executed.

00:40:36.610 --> 00:40:37.720
Good.

00:40:38.660 --> 00:40:41.850
We didn't foresee that Kamishiro would be a larva.

00:40:41.850 --> 00:40:45.430
We can't disregard Kannazuki's actions either.

00:40:45.430 --> 00:40:49.750
After all these years, we now face a new problem.

00:40:49.750 --> 00:40:52.950
We need to define a new order.

00:40:52.950 --> 00:40:58.260
Who defines order and enforces it across the globe?

00:41:00.180 --> 00:41:02.780
We, Ordo, do.

00:41:14.530 --> 00:41:16.100
Please carry him over here.

00:41:17.920 --> 00:41:19.220
Excuse me.

00:41:19.220 --> 00:41:21.220
Can I have a few words with you?

00:41:23.640 --> 00:41:25.870
We were just desk workers.

00:41:25.870 --> 00:41:27.330
I'm completely at sea about what happened.

00:41:33.020 --> 00:41:35.160
Right. Please bear the pain for a bit.

00:41:35.160 --> 00:41:36.560
Ow.

00:41:36.560 --> 00:41:38.430
Guys!

00:41:38.430 --> 00:41:40.430
We're here to pick you up!

00:41:41.220 --> 00:41:42.550
Where's Kiri-chan?

00:41:42.550 --> 00:41:44.430
She's watching the house with the kids.

00:41:44.430 --> 00:41:47.350
I'm glad you're all okay!

00:41:47.350 --> 00:41:49.270
You did great.

00:41:49.270 --> 00:41:50.770
Thank you.

00:41:50.770 --> 00:41:52.780
Don't you dare touch me!

00:41:53.350 --> 00:41:55.500
Who do you think I am?

00:41:55.500 --> 00:41:57.290
We're just going to treat you.

00:41:57.290 --> 00:41:58.740
This is going to be difficult.

00:42:00.850 --> 00:42:01.840
Where's Quon?

00:42:11.740 --> 00:42:14.490
Quon saved us.

00:42:14.490 --> 00:42:16.410
It was amazing.

00:42:16.410 --> 00:42:19.260
He was even faster than Takao-san's teleportation.

00:42:21.660 --> 00:42:22.490
Quon.

00:42:28.350 --> 00:42:30.980
D-Don't tell me...

00:42:38.320 --> 00:42:40.320
Towa set me free...

00:42:43.980 --> 00:42:46.580
from a spell, at long last.

00:42:52.810 --> 00:42:55.590
All this while, I'd been frozen in time.

00:42:57.100 --> 00:43:00.160
Finally, I've been set free.

00:43:12.560 --> 00:43:17.610
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:43:17.610 --> 00:43:25.830
A scream of my burning soul that seems to burst out of my chest

00:43:17.610 --> 00:43:25.620
mune no oku hajike sou na atsui tamashii no sakebi wo

00:43:25.830 --> 00:43:32.380
Burst on the fire

00:43:46.100 --> 00:43:51.230
I was struck by thunderstorm, suddenly awakening my instinct

00:43:46.100 --> 00:43:51.230
raiu ni utare totsuzen mezameta honnou

00:43:51.230 --> 00:43:55.770
It burns on, pushing aside my sensibility

00:43:51.230 --> 00:43:55.770
risei wo oshinokete moetagiru no sa

00:43:55.770 --> 00:44:00.860
The truth is written on the walls of memory

00:43:55.770 --> 00:44:00.860
kioku no kabe ni kakikomareta shinjitsu wa

00:44:00.860 --> 00:44:05.200
No one can violate it

00:44:00.860 --> 00:44:05.070
dare ni mo okasenai

00:44:05.200 --> 00:44:14.630
We have no questions; we just want to break the structure of this world with our hands

00:44:05.330 --> 00:44:14.580
gimon nante nai kono sekai no shikumi wo buchikowashichimae so no te de

00:44:14.630 --> 00:44:24.800
Clear up the fate that befalls me, and then run to the future! Get on!

00:44:14.630 --> 00:44:24.800
furikakaru sadame kirihiraki ima mirai e kakenukero! Get on!

00:44:24.800 --> 00:44:29.680
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:44:29.680 --> 00:44:34.230
With an unknown power second to none,
I will change the direction of the wind

00:44:29.680 --> 00:44:34.230
