00:45:07.680 --> 00:45:12.810
akumu no you na kumikomareta genjitsu ni

00:45:12.810 --> 00:45:17.400
Even if we lose our place, and it's filled with shit

00:45:12.810 --> 00:45:17.400
yukiba ushinatte funtsumattemo

00:45:17.400 --> 00:45:22.440
If we never lose the courage to get hurt

00:45:17.400 --> 00:45:22.440
kizutsuku yuuki itsudemo nakusanai nara

00:45:22.440 --> 00:45:26.860
Our answers will not change

00:45:22.440 --> 00:45:26.780
kotae wa kawaranai

00:45:26.860 --> 00:45:36.370
